        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sören Opti, Lee Chong Wei, Derek Wong Zi Liang\n- Events: 2016 Summer Olympics\n- Places: Rio de Janeiro, Brazil\n- Topics: badminton\n\nFacts:\n- At the 2016 Summer Olympics, Sören Opti competed in badminton in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.\n- During group play at the 2016 Summer Olympics, Sören Opti lost to Lee Chong Wei of Malaysia and Derek Wong Zi Liang of Singapore.\n- Sören Opti did not advance beyond group play at the 2016 Summer Olympics.\n- Lee Chong Wei was born on 21 October 1982.\n- Lee Chong Wei is a Malaysian professional badminton player.",
